<hr data-start="1318" data-end="1321">
<h2 data-section-id="wzosfz" data-start="1323" data-end="1349">⚠️ Common hidden causes</h2>
<ul data-start="1351" data-end="1541">
<li data-section-id="19lkvmp" data-start="1351" data-end="1425">
<p data-start="1353" data-end="1425">Calling <code data-start="1361" data-end="1375">multi_cell()</code> <strong data-start="1376" data-end="1425">after a <code data-start="1386" data-end="1403">cell(..., ln=0)</code> without resetting X</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1a7nivz" data-start="1426" data-end="1452">
<p data-start="1428" data-end="1452">Custom margins too large</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ii5e2d" data-start="1453" data-end="1512">
<p data-start="1455" data-end="1512">Writing inside a very narrow column or after shifting <code data-start="1509" data-end="1512">x</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="lzv1v5" data-start="1513" data-end="1541">
<p data-start="1515" data-end="1541">Empty or malformed strings</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1543" data-end="1546">
<h2 data-section-id="4248xx" data-start="1548" data-end="1563">💡 Debug tip</h2>
