<h2 data-section-id="1tmbgbi" data-start="1657" data-end="1678">🧠 Important notes</h2>
<ul data-start="1680" data-end="1865">
<li data-section-id="3pank4" data-start="1680" data-end="1755">
<p data-start="1682" data-end="1755">Add <code data-start="1686" data-end="1703">import textwrap</code> <strong data-start="1704" data-end="1723">once at the top</strong> (not inside every loop ideally)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6uzgax" data-start="1756" data-end="1810">
<p data-start="1758" data-end="1810">The number <code data-start="1769" data-end="1773">80</code> = wrap width (you can tweak: 60–100)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="q6z9zy" data-start="1811" data-end="1865">
<p data-start="1813" data-end="1865">This helps prevent issues with <strong data-start="1844" data-end="1865">very long strings</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1867" data-end="1870">
<h2 data-section-id="15vmxwy" data-start="1872" data-end="1891">⚠️ Reality check</h2>
<p data-start="1893" data-end="1945">This wrapping is <strong data-start="1910" data-end="1926">extra safety</strong>, not the main fix.</p>
<p data-start="1947" data-end="1971">👉 The <strong data-start="1954" data-end="1966">real fix</strong> was:</p>
<ul data-start="1972" data-end="2035">
<li data-section-id="ym4zcx" data-start="1972" data-end="1999">
<p data-start="1974" data-end="1999"><code data-start="1974" data-end="1999">pdf.set_x(pdf.l_margin)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17cnvb1" data-start="2000" data-end="2035">
<p data-start="2002" data-end="2035">using <code data-start="2008" data-end="2020">page_width</code> instead of <code data-start="2032" data-end="2035">0</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
