<h3 data-section-id="16dyrm7" data-start="2561" data-end="2571">✅ Now:</h3>
<ul data-start="2572" data-end="2697">
<li data-section-id="xcsi6w" data-start="2572" data-end="2618">
<p data-start="2574" data-end="2618">Everything is properly inside <code data-start="2604" data-end="2618">create_pdf()</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vr42o3" data-start="2619" data-end="2642">
<p data-start="2621" data-end="2642">No indentation errors</p>
</li>
