</li>
<li data-section-id="rn724e" data-start="2671" data-end="2697">
<p data-start="2673" data-end="2697">Long text safely wrapped</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2699" data-end="2702">
<h2 data-section-id="e6hrq2" data-start="2704" data-end="2725">🧠 Quick checklist</h2>
<p data-start="2727" data-end="2915">✔ <code data-start="2729" data-end="2746">import textwrap</code> → already correct at top<br data-start="2771" data-end="2774">
✔ <code data-start="2776" data-end="2797">set_x(pdf.l_margin)</code> → prevents width bug<br data-start="2818" data-end="2821">
✔ <code data-start="2823" data-end="2835">page_width</code> → avoids <code data-start="2845" data-end="2865">multi_cell(0, ...)</code> issue<br data-start="2871" data-end="2874">
✔ wrapping → avoids long string crashes</p>
<hr data-start="2917" data-end="2920">
<h2 data-section-id="qjmjja" data-start="2922" data-end="2958">💡 Optional upgrade (if you want)</h2>
