<h2 data-section-id="17626gy" data-start="1722" data-end="1744">🚀 Result after fix</h2>
<p data-start="1746" data-end="1851">✔ No floating text on right<br data-start="1773" data-end="1776">
✔ Proper left alignment<br data-start="1799" data-end="1802">
