<h1 data-section-id="1kfinjp" data-start="3853" data-end="3886">💡 Pro Tip (Highly Recommended)</h1>
<p data-start="3888" data-end="3940">From your CV, you have <strong data-start="3911" data-end="3934">VERY strong content</strong>, but:</p>
<ul data-start="3941" data-end="3989">
<li data-section-id="16riufl" data-start="3941" data-end="3959">
<p data-start="3943" data-end="3959">It’s too verbose</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="186qlny" data-start="3960" data-end="3989">
<p data-start="3962" data-end="3989">Some bullets are repetitive</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3991" data-end="4013">👉 If you want, I can:</p>
<ul data-start="4014" data-end="4162">
<li data-section-id="193hhep" data-start="4014" data-end="4076">
<p data-start="4016" data-end="4076">Convert this into a <strong data-start="4036" data-end="4076">top-tier ATS resume (McKinsey-style)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="13q01kb" data-start="4077" data-end="4114">
<p data-start="4079" data-end="4114">Reduce to <strong data-start="4089" data-end="4114">impact-driven bullets</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1uxa9fl" data-start="4115" data-end="4162">
<p data-start="4117" data-end="4162">Add <strong data-start="4121" data-end="4162">metrics + keywords for hiring systems</strong></p>
