"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="57711e80-6b00-4a1a-afe1-7efc97cdf4fb" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="91">Alright—this is where we move from “functional export” to <strong data-start="58" data-end="90">professional CV-grade output</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="93" data-end="158">Your current PDF/Word export is plain text. Your original CV has:</p>
<ul data-start="159" data-end="233">
<li data-section-id="1u4o22z" data-start="159" data-end="179">
<p data-start="161" data-end="179">visual hierarchy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ziot61" data-start="180" data-end="191">
<p data-start="182" data-end="191">spacing</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1p8nkb7" data-start="192" data-end="211">
<p data-start="194" data-end="211">section styling</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gi3wgz" data-start="212" data-end="233">
<p data-start="214" data-end="233">structured layout</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="235" data-end="260">We’ll recreate that with:</p>
<ul data-start="261" data-end="391">
<li data-section-id="psdh6m" data-start="261" data-end="278">
<p data-start="263" data-end="278"><strong data-start="263" data-end="278">header band</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1xccu0n" data-start="279" data-end="304">
<p data-start="281" data-end="304"><strong data-start="281" data-end="304">bold section titles</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7sa8sp" data-start="305" data-end="329">
<p data-start="307" data-end="329"><strong data-start="307" data-end="329">consistent spacing</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="slfyfs" data-start="330" data-end="349">
<p data-start="332" data-end="349"><strong data-start="332" data-end="349">clean bullets</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1nlf8hw" data-start="350" data-end="391">
<p data-start="352" data-end="391"><strong data-start="352" data-end="391">Word styles (Heading, Normal, etc.)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="393" data-end="396">
<h1 data-section-id="rbj1c3" data-start="398" data-end="441">✅ 🎨 1. Redesigned PDF (Styled CV Layout)</h1>
<h3 data-section-id="81s9h3" data-start="443" data-end="488"><span role="text">🔧 Replace your <code data-start="463" data-end="477">create_pdf()</code> with this:</span></h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="490" data-end="3085"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Python</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><button class="btn relative group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-width:1.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-offset:2.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-style:solid] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-color:var(--text-primary)] btn-ghost border-token-border-default ms-2 border font-sans" aria-label="Run code" type="button"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-label="" class="-ms-0.5 icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#6ef7a4" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Run</div></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼg">def</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">create_pdf</span><span>():</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">FPDF</span><span>()</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>add_page()</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>set_auto_page_break(</span><span class="ͼm">auto</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">True</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">margin</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">12</span><span>)</span><br><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">page_width</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>w </span><span class="ͼg">-</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>l_margin </span><span class="ͼg">-</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>r_margin</span><br><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼe"># ===== HEADER =====</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>set_fill_color(</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">60</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">90</span><span>)  </span><span class="ͼe"># dark blue</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>rect(</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>w, </span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼk">'F'</span><span>)</span><br><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>set_text_color(</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>)</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>set_font(</span><span class="ͼk">"Arial"</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼk">"B"</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">16</span><span>)</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>set_xy(</span><span class="ͼj">10</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">10</span><span>)</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>cell(</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">8</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼk">"Raj Singh"</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼm">ln</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span>)</span><br><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>set_font(</span><span class="ͼk">"Arial"</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼk">""</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">12</span><span>)</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>set_x(</span><span class="ͼj">10</span><span>)</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼm">pdf</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>cell(</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><spa