<p data-start="62" data-end="154">I’ve converted your CV into a <strong data-start="92" data-end="128">clean, normalized JSON structure</strong> that works perfectly for:</p>
<ul data-start="155" data-end="226">
<li data-section-id="12tprqx" data-start="155" data-end="169">
<p data-start="157" data-end="169">Streamlit UI</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hy51gc" data-start="170" data-end="186">
<p data-start="172" data-end="186">PDF generation</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1dz9vs2" data-start="187" data-end="200">
<p data-start="189" data-end="200">Word export</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17v7dz3" data-start="201" data-end="226">
<p data-start="203" data-end="226">Future APIs / databases</p>
</li>
</ul>
