<h3 data-section-id="dvvpuk" data-start="7062" data-end="7095">💎 2. Drag &amp; reorder sections</h3>
<h3 data-section-id="sdx93b" data-start="7096" data-end="7137">💎 3. Login + save resumes (Firebase)</h3>
