<h1 data-section-id="5oq5i8" data-start="238" data-end="272">🚀 🧠 PRODUCT-LEVEL ARCHITECTURE</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="lmkkg4" data-start="274" data-end="312">🔥 Core stack (simple but powerful)</h2>
<ul data-start="314" data-end="515">
<li data-section-id="1tecvg4" data-start="314" data-end="371">
<p data-start="316" data-end="371"><strong data-start="316" data-end="329">Frontend:</strong> Streamlit (keep for now) or React later</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="wy4e3d" data-start="372" data-end="400">
<p data-start="374" data-end="400"><strong data-start="374" data-end="390">Backend/API:</strong> FastAPI</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16xamdz" data-start="401" data-end="437">
<p data-start="403" data-end="437"><strong data-start="403" data-end="416">Database:</strong> Firebase / MongoDB</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="fda8lb" data-start="438" data-end="465">
<p data-start="440" data-end="465"><strong data-start="440" data-end="449">Auth:</strong> Firebase Auth</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1uo4z27" data-start="466" data-end="515">
<p data-start="468" data-end="515"><strong data-start="468" data-end="480">Storage:</strong> Firebase Storage (for PDFs/images)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="517" data-end="520">
<h1 data-section-id="uqfc2n" data-start="522" data-end="572">💎 1. Multi-Template Resume System (BIG upgrade)</h1>
<p data-start="574" data-end="631">Right now → 1 PDF style<br data-start="597" data-end="600">
Goal → multiple templates like:</p>
<ul data-start="633" data-end="714">
<li data-section-id="da1gz0" data-start="633" data-end="657">
<p data-start="635" data-end="657">Classic (ATS friendly)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1kfrwz9" data-start="658" data-end="683">
<p data-start="660" data-end="683">Modern (colored header)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3mrs8t" data-start="684" data-end="714">
<p data-start="686" data-end="714">Executive (minimal, premium)</p>
</li>
</ul>
