<hr data-start="4256" data-end="4259">
<h1 data-section-id="e5pboa" data-start="4261" data-end="4286">⚠️ Honest reality check</h1>
<p data-start="4288" data-end="4327">Most resume builders fail because they:</p>
<ul data-start="4328" data-end="4373">
<li data-section-id="1yd3ek4" data-start="4328" data-end="4350">
<p data-start="4330" data-end="4350">are just CRUD apps</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1km25w8" data-start="4351" data-end="4373">
<p data-start="4353" data-end="4373">no differentiation</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4375" data-end="4398">👉 Your edge should be:</p>
<ul data-start="4399" data-end="4478">
<li data-section-id="1ut3jiu" data-start="4399" data-end="4422">
<p data-start="4401" data-end="4422">AI-enhanced bullets</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1arn0k7" data-start="4423" data-end="4456">
<p data-start="4425" data-end="4456">HSE/domain-specific templates</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="wlis9i" data-start="4457" data-end="4478">
<p data-start="4459" data-end="4478">Strong PDF output</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="4480" data-end="4483">
<h1 data-section-id="bc1zim" data-start="4485" data-end="4511">🚀 If you want next step</h1>
<p data-start="4513" data-end="4523">I can now:</p>
<ul data-start="4524" data-end="4643">
<li data-section-id="15a85x" data-start="4524" data-end="4563">
<p data-start="4526" data-end="4563"><span class="entity-underline hover:entity-accent group inline cursor-pointer align-baseline whitespace-nowrap" role="button" tabindex="0"><span class="inline-flex items-center overflow-hidden align-middle" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 1; width: 1.5rem;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="group-hover:entity-accent icon text-token-text-primary inline-block transition-transform duration-150 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#e04414" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span><span class="group-hover:entity-accent whitespace-normal">Build <strong data-start="6" data-end="49" data-is-last-node="" node="[object Object]" class="group-hover:entity-accent">template system fully (3 designs ready)</strong></span></span></p>
