<h1 data-section-id="hxfiao" data-start="6842" data-end="6873">💡 Next upgrade (high impact)</h1>
<p data-start="6875" data-end="6941">If you want this to look like a <strong data-start="6907" data-end="6926">real premium CV</strong>, next step is:</p>
