<hr data-start="794" data-end="797">
<h1 data-section-id="l7zota" data-start="799" data-end="832">✅ Verify files (very important)</h1>
<p data-start="834" data-end="849">After download:</p>
<ul data-start="851" data-end="924">
<li data-section-id="r113zc" data-start="851" data-end="879">
<p data-start="853" data-end="879">Size should be <strong data-start="868" data-end="879">~700KB+</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="mbkix5" data-start="880" data-end="891">
<p data-start="882" data-end="891">NOT 1KB ❌</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="p3wwkx" data-start="892" data-end="924">
<p data-start="894" data-end="924">Opening it should preview font</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="926" data-end="929">
<h1 data-section-id="d0yolo" data-start="931" data-end="957">✅ Final folder structure</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="959" data-end="1084"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>SHE-SUITE/</span><br><span>│</span><br><span>├── app.py</span><br><span>├── data.py</span><br><span>├── profile.jpg</span><br><span>└── fonts/</span><br><span>    ├── DejaVuSans.ttf</span><br><span>    └── DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1086" data-end="1089">
<h1 data-section-id="jdj2jx" data-start="1091" data-end="1127">⚠️ Alternative (if download fails)</h1>
<p data-start="1129" data-end="1159">You can also use system fonts:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="liz1q" data-start="1161" data-end="1178">Windows path:</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1179" data-end="1217"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6d2147a0.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>C:\Windows\Fonts\arial.ttf</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
